mm.\n\nLet's not go down this path.\n\nLet me instead save this injection record and see its card subtitle. Could reveal poor formatting like \"Injection · Ampule · 5 mg\" or \" · 5 mg\". Let's save (date/time defaults okay) and view Plan card."}
