m nav Plan element 28? Current observe after swipe: element 28 Plan? Actually latest observe elements: [28] Plan (bottom nav) at (417,2189). Yes.\n\nWait, current screen Home scrolled. Let me use bottom nav Plan. But careful: my last action was a file_report, screen unchanged. The latest observe is still valid. Tap 28."}
